cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the version of this research note and Lean materials that you used."
title: "Outerplanarity from the Z-polynomial of a graphic matroid"
authors:
  - family-names: Raj
    given-names: Steve
version: 1.0.0
abstract: >-
  A research note characterizing outerplanarity of finite simple 2-connected
  graphs by their graphic matroid Z-polynomials and establishing the
  Narayana Z-polynomial identity for connected ribbon lattice path matroids.
  The release includes the original note dated November 25, 2026 and partial
  Lean 4 verification materials.
keywords:
  - outerplanar graphs
  - graphic matroids
  - matroid Z-polynomials
  - Narayana polynomials
  - ribbon lattice path matroids
  - Lean 4
